# Cerberus Security Scanner Exception Policy
# Format:
# # <VULNERABILITY_ID> [exp:YYYY-MM-DD] [owner:owner@cerberus.internal] [justification:Detailed technical justification (min 15 chars)]
# <VULNERABILITY_ID>
#
# All entries are strictly validated by scripts/verify_security_exceptions.py in CI.
# Any exception without an unexpired date, valid owner, or sufficient justification will immediately fail CI.

